/**
 * Demo data. Idempotent: re-running it updates the same accounts and products
 * instead of creating duplicates, so `make seed` is safe at any time.
 *
 * The five products are real GLB files with real animation clips, generated by
 * `pnpm --filter @3dsfera/tools run gen:assets` and committed under
 * prisma/seed-assets. They go through the same upload validation and the same
 * optimization pipeline a supplier's file does — the seeded world is not a
 * special case.
 */
